Feature: Authentication (Register / Login)
 1. Register Test Cases
     TC-01: Register with valid data
        Steps:
           Open Sign Up screen
           Enter valid name, email, password, confirm password
           Click Sign Up
        Expected Result:
           User is registered successfully and success message is shown
        Status: PASS
     TC-02: Register with empty fields
        Steps:
           Leave all fields empty
           Click Sign Up
        Expected Result:
           Validation errors appear under fields
        Status: PASS
     TC-03: Register with invalid email
        Steps:
           Enter invalid email (test)
           Fill other fields correctly
           Click Sign Up
        Expected Result:
           Email validation error appears
        Status: PASS
     TC-04: Register with weak password
        Steps:
            Enter password “123”
            Click Sign Up
        Expected Result:
            Password validation error appears
        Status: PASS
     TC-05: Register with already existing email
        Steps:
            Enter email that already exists in system
            Click Sign Up
        Expected Result:
             Error message returned from API (Email already exists)
        Status: PASS
2. Login Test Cases
     TC-06: Login with valid credentials
        Steps:
            Enter correct email and password
            Click Login
        Expected Result:
            User logs in successfully
        Status: PASS
     TC-07: Login with wrong password
        Steps:
            Enter valid email + wrong password
            Click Login
        Expected Result:
            Error message appears
        Status: PASS
     TC-08: Login with unregistered email
        Steps:
            Enter email not in system
            Click Login
        Expected Result:
            Error message from API
        Status: PASS3. Edge Cases
     TC-09: Network failure
        Steps:
            Turn off internet
            Try login/register
        Expected Result:
            Error message shown (network error)
        Status: PASS
     TC-10: Password mismatch
        Steps:
            Enter password = "Aa123456"
            Confirm password = "Aa123"
        Expected Result:
            "Passwords do not match" error appears
        Status: PASS
Notes
     Validation handled in UI (client-side)
     API validation handled by backend (server-side)
     Errors handled via Cubit states (AuthError)
     Success handled via AuthSuccessMessage

